Must-Prepare Ansible Topics for DevOps Interviews 👇
🔹 What is Ansible and how does it work?
✔️ Agentless configuration management tool
✔️ Uses SSH for communication
✔️ Written in YAML
✔️ Follows push-based architecture
🔹 How do you install and configure Ansible?
✔️ Install Ansible on control node
✔️ Configure inventory file (hosts)
✔️ Set up SSH key-based authentication
✔️ Test connectivity using ansible all -m ping
🔹 What is an Inventory file?
✔️ Defines managed nodes
✔️ Can be static or dynamic
✔️ Supports groups and variables
🔹 What are Playbooks in Ansible?
✔️ Written in YAML
✔️ Contains plays and tasks
✔️ Executes tasks sequentially
✔️ Ensures idempotency
🔹 Roles in Ansible
✔️ Reusable and modular structure
✔️ Improves readability
✔️ Used for complex automation
🔹 Variables in Ansible
✔️ Group variables
✔️ Host variables
✔️ Vars files
✔️ Extra vars
🔹 How to secure Ansible?
✔️ Use Ansible Vault for secrets
✔️ SSH key-based authentication
✔️ Restrict sudo access
📌 These topics are commonly asked in DevOps interviews.
